    {
      "kind": "topic",
      "text": "## The problem is wasted work.",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000038"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
      "origin": "source",
      "chunkId": "c0001-flat-03",
      "annotations": [
        "repair_source_fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "source",
      "text": "Ordinary λ-calculus is wonderfully compact. The familiar story—“replace a variable with an argument”—hides a cost question: what should happen when the variable is unused, or when it appears many times?",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000039"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
